# In-Kind Redemption Flow

Authoritative sequence from DESIGN.md and RobinVault/GrowthStrategy implementation.

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor Owner
    participant V as RobinVault
    participant G as GrowthStrategy
    participant R as Receiver

    Owner->>V: redeemInKind(shares, receiver, owner)
    V->>V: validate shares, receiver, maxRedeem
    V->>G: previewInKindRedemption(shares)
    G-->>V: preview
    V->>V: burn shares, reduce strategyDebt & lockedProfit
    V->>G: redeemInKind(shares, debtReduction, receiver, maxLossBps)
    G->>G: update retainedBalance, refresh exposure
    opt need deployed INDEX
        G->>G: _freeFunds (maxLoss check)
    end
    G->>R: transfer retained tokens
    G->>V: transfer INDEX to vault
    G-->>V: actual result
    V->>V: verify preview vs actual
    V->>R: transfer net INDEX
    V-->>Owner: InKindRedeem event
```
